    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07700c30ea7697bdc0d693f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……谢谢你神明！\n请继续看着我下场比赛的表现吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77c293341b0de04b1337e8a3029a9de3f8615b2c251a6ba908ac935d63de1a7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1064/storytimeline_501064707.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3dab35368d928f783905c9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白善信完全恢复精神。\n我也在心中\n向神明道谢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5789be4c325b6eb7881464a85255d29e6b68613c1cb285d9139060ded2fcbde",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
