    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6660795e265d7b6418f35e36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……但是，就在此时强风吹过，\n把好不容易扫在一起的垃圾\n全都吹走了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae27ff8e08267c09f2c692f6b24b4e2887e84e0478614f4b08b4538b3810c7dc",
